{%- comment -%}
  gumis wordmark — Fredoka Bold, always lowercase, Berry by default.
  The dot of the "i" is an orange gummy: a dotless ı (U+0131) plus a rounded shape.
  Accepts: font_size (CSS font-size), light (boolean, white text), class.
  Usage: {% render 'logo', font_size: '3rem' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<span
  class="gumis-logo{% if light %} gumis-logo--light{% endif %}{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  {% if font_size %}
    style="--logo-size: {{ font_size }};"
  {% endif %}
>
  <span class="visually-hidden">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
  <span class="gumis-logo__word" aria-hidden="true">gum<span class="gumis-logo__i">ı</span>s</span>
</span>
